    <briefdescription>
<para>Resource representation for branch nodes in a spatial tree. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This class aggregates the resource data from child terrain cells in a branch. It provides methods to update biomass, calculate available dry mass, apply branch-level updates, and deserialize resource information from applied sources. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
